and therefore he is just outright dead.

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:50.440
No more "Continue?"s for him!

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:54.660
Tallying up the Disney films with just a single-digit death toll gives us forty-one,

00:13:54.660 --> 00:14:00.600
which leaves us seventeen left to cover, but this is where things start to get difficult.

